1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,400
I can’t tell my family what I want without feeling
ungrateful.

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:09,635
Private reflection you can correct before exploring peer
experiences.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:14,530
What Arjun said; a possibility to check; then he can correct
it.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,100
Prepared local reply; no model.

5
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:20,465
Arjun chooses Not quite.

6
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:25,735
He edits the words to keep the focus on his parents and his
own time.

7
00:00:26,500 --> 00:00:31,685
Now the editable reflection changes: no one chooses stay or
leave for him.

8
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:36,300
The reflection stays editable; Arjun decides.

9
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:42,355
Planned Muse Spark: organize possibilities for Arjun to
review, not decide.

10
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:46,095
Day four: Ravi needs time to choose.

11
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:49,800
Another member sees it differently.

12
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:53,300
Day nine: the conversation stayed difficult.

13
00:00:53,500 --> 00:00:57,160
Host: I can listen; I can’t decide for you.

14
00:00:57,700 --> 00:01:00,300
Prepared; no report.

15
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:04,200
Day sixteen: Dev’s question still has no replies.

16
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:08,720
Fictional historical examples, prepared and not live.

17
00:01:10,056 --> 00:01:14,356
Ravi accepts group replies only, not private messages.

18
00:01:14,556 --> 00:01:18,856
Arjun edits the exact question; the group preview changes.

19
00:01:19,056 --> 00:01:23,356
Alias and group audience visible; private context excluded.

20
00:01:23,556 --> 00:01:27,676
Consent is unchecked; continue remains disabled.

21
00:01:28,056 --> 00:01:30,411
This preview sends nothing.

22
00:01:35,572 --> 00:01:38,682
No provider is verified or bookable here.

23
00:01:39,572 --> 00:01:42,492
Arjun returns to peer perspectives.

24
00:01:44,572 --> 00:01:47,892
Arjun keeps time to decide for himself.

25
00:01:49,072 --> 00:01:51,877
He can keep the thought without sharing it.

26
00:01:53,572 --> 00:01:56,617
A contribution remains optional.

27
00:01:58,072 --> 00:02:01,617
Nothing about the future is decided for him.

28
00:02:05,572 --> 00:02:09,372
Maybe later means no contribution is required.

29
00:02:09,572 --> 00:02:12,067
The reflection can stay private.

30
00:02:13,828 --> 00:02:17,433
Arjun chooses one helpful thing he could offer Dev.

31
00:02:20,013 --> 00:02:23,888
He reviews the exact local draft for the fictional group.

32
00:02:24,263 --> 00:02:28,313
The alias stays visible; private context is excluded.

33
00:02:28,513 --> 00:02:32,558
Consent is unchecked; posting stays disabled.

34
00:02:32,763 --> 00:02:34,543
Nothing is sent.

35
00:02:37,013 --> 00:02:39,778
Arjun keeps the takeaway he chose.

36
00:02:41,213 --> 00:02:45,213
The Dev draft is optional and limited to one helpful thing.

37
00:02:45,413 --> 00:02:48,653
Prepared local draft for a fictional group.

38
00:02:49,613 --> 00:02:52,328
Nothing is sent without consent.

39
00:02:55,213 --> 00:02:57,388
Arjun can leave it here.
